# Requires review before a change to CI or the reusable action itself can be merged.
#
# Unlike the sibling repos, this one publishes no package — the supply-chain
# artifact here is `.github/actions/gate-check`, a reusable composite action that
# other projects consume by reference. Its `check.sh` therefore executes inside
# *someone else's* CI run, so an unreviewed edit to it is a supply-chain change,
# not just a local one. `gate-check.yml` and `ci.yml` gate this repo's own PRs and
# are worth the same protection for the same reason: a workflow that can silently
# weaken its own gate defeats the point of having one.
